      "writtenOn": "2016-08-17T21:51:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest only calling the HostPolicy check when starting the ACME process (and documenting that).\n\nIt\u0027ll be cheaper, and it\u0027ll let someone point a binary at a prepopulated cache with a RejectAllHosts() policy and have that do something useful.",
