      "writtenOn": "2016-08-17T22:54:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Really? So this is a required field and it should be above Cache.\n\nBut this might be an overly-strict policy. I think a better default policy would be to check the machine\u0027s hostname, and/or check that the domain name\u0027s DNS points to this machine\u0027s local IP. Or even allow everything, maybe rate-limited.\n\nI don\u0027t like the idea of this being a required field for most casual users. (but I do think we need some sort of default protection)",
      "revId": "18b76d22ec7017a2bc21165f67c7c34d14d5cb4b",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
